[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/core/map_tile_data.gd" id="2_tiledata"]

; mvp_chapter_10 — 적벽 본전 (Chibi Main / Battle of Red Cliffs proper)
; 12 cols × 9 rows. Wide RIVER strip at cols 5-6 splits the field into the
; Wei advance (west) vs allied position (east). THREE BRIDGE crossings at
; rows 2/4/6 — main road at row 4 (ROAD adjacency cols 4 + 7); 황충 + 손권
; flank via HILLS at (10,3) and (10,5) on the east shore. The signature
; chibi mechanic is FIRE terrain (terrain_type=8, session-21): 4 burning
; ship debris tiles on the Wei side — (1,2), (0,4), (1,4), (1,6) — that
; damage any unit standing on them at round start via _apply_fire_damage_
; on_round_start (BalanceConstant FIRE_DAMAGE_PER_TURN). The player tactical
; goal is to STUN/charm the Wei general into a fire tile and watch the
; burn ticks finish them off.
;
; Narrative: 조조의 본대 100만 대군이 강을 따라 내려와 정박. 동남풍이 부는
; 적벽 강어귀에서 주유의 화공 계획이 실행된다 — 천 척의 배가 강 위에서 타고,
; 위군 정예 (조조 + 하후돈 + 장요 + 우금 + 허저)가 강변에 좌초된다.
;
; Terrain ids: 0 PLAINS  1 FOREST  2 HILLS  3 MOUNTAIN  4 RIVER  5 BRIDGE
;              7 ROAD  8 FIRE (session-21 — burning ship debris)

